    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/3e9dcf617711833ca55ce6b37d1c13ab.avif?t=1725552304\" width=608 height=70 /></span><br><br>Jump and Dash your way through the game in this fast-paced, challenging 2D Precision Platformer game for those who want to put their skills to their limits!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/ca54848272332203631113ec57e0b7db.poster.avif?t=1725552304\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/ca54848272332203631113ec57e0b7db.webm?t=1725552304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/ca54848272332203631113ec57e0b7db.mp4?t=1725552304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/d8c31ebab1f06a0b9785a36606460ac8.avif?t=1725552304\" width=608 height=70 /></span><br><br>Shout after failing a challenge, before facing a tight room full of spikes, and SHOUT A LOT after overcoming the hardest levels. Let all that energy out through the <strong>CRY</strong>!!!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/53d2ccb020b37f70bef71c824317315f.poster.avif?t=1725552304\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/53d2ccb020b37f70bef71c824317315f.webm?t=1725552304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/53d2ccb020b37f70bef71c824317315f.mp4?t=1725552304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Over 40 unique levels with replayability</strong><br><br>Over 40 levels with progressive difficulty and mechanics, that can be cleared in several ways, with secrets, collectibles, and challenges!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/47bb137db2f70c3992f7fc4bd227e696.poster.avif?t=1725552304\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/47bb137db2f70c3992f7fc4bd227e696.webm?t=1725552304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/47bb137db2f70c3992f7fc4bd227e696.mp4?t=1725552304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Achievements and Challenges</strong><br><br>Besides clearing the game, even harder content awaits if you wanna tackle on DASH n CRY challenges, where you must complete levels in unintended, much more challenging ways!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/f2a1288de978114062241368e99b108e.avif?t=1725552304\" width=608 height=70 /></span><br><br>For those who cleared the game, but still want more, tackle on challenging secret areas inside the main levels to find hidden collectibles, or challenge the EX levels, based on the main level mechanics, but tuned up in difficulty to the (EX)treme!<br><br><strong>Assist Mode</strong><br><br>Activate Assist mode to get the power of a god. Invincibility? Infinite Jumps? Infinite Dashes? All Levels Unlocked? We have it all at your disposal. <i>Assist Mode might disable some Achievement and Challenge Rewards.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/e53b15c5acef15bf5e0e767d135c7ec5.avif?t=1725552304\" width=608 height=182 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/3e9dcf617711833ca55ce6b37d1c13ab.avif?t=1725552304\" width=608 height=70 /></span><br><br>Jump and Dash your way through the game in this fast-paced, challenging 2D Precision Platformer game for those who want to put their skills to their limits!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/ca54848272332203631113ec57e0b7db.poster.avif?t=1725552304\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/ca54848272332203631113ec57e0b7db.webm?t=1725552304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/ca54848272332203631113ec57e0b7db.mp4?t=1725552304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/d8c31ebab1f06a0b9785a36606460ac8.avif?t=1725552304\" width=608 height=70 /></span><br><br>Shout after failing a challenge, before facing a tight room full of spikes, and SHOUT A LOT after overcoming the hardest levels. Let all that energy out through the <strong>CRY</strong>!!!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/53d2ccb020b37f70bef71c824317315f.poster.avif?t=1725552304\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/53d2ccb020b37f70bef71c824317315f.webm?t=1725552304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982480/extras/53d